     },
     {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Karousel takes over from \"Keep playing similar music\" and keeps its setting, so if that was on (the default), Karousel is on. Its switch is now in **Settings → Playback**."
     },
     {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "### Also"
